<view class="page"><view class="page-masthead"><image class="masthead-icon" src="/assets/icons/shop.png"/><view class="masthead-copy"><view class="page-title">社区商家</view><view class="masthead-subtitle">发现身边的生活服务</view></view></view><view class="muted">商家公示的营业执照名称和统一社会信用代码可在详情查看。</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}<button bindtap="load">重试</button></view><view wx:for="{{list}}" wx:key="_id" class="card" data-id="{{item._id}}" bindtap="open"><view class="section-title">{{item.name}}</view><view>{{item.categoryName}}</view><view class="muted">评分 {{item.ratingText}} · 查看服务 ›</view></view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="card">正在加载…</view><view wx:elif="{{!list.length && !error}}" class="card">本小区暂时没有已入驻商家</view></view>
